  "name" : "TemperatureAlert",
  "options" : {
    "description" : "The Quickstart Tutorial demonstrates the Design Modeler, a visual IDE tool for building Vantiq systems. It uses Claude Code, a Generative AI product that allows the user to enter a text description of the system to be built then turns that description into the beginnings of the running application.\n\n**Please note**: the temperature sensor data is read from a public MQTT Source that is disabled by default in this Project. Use the Active Resource Control Center (seen below) to activate the *com.vantiq.temp.TempMQTT* Source by clicking its **Active** slider. Also, note that the *users* setting in the NotifyMaintenance task has been updated to use *Context.username()* so that it will work with your username in the Vantiq mobile app.",
